  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组增加了 Macaw's Mods 与 Regions Unexplored 之间的兼容性。你是否一直梦想建造红木桥……现在，借助本模组，这个梦想终于可以实现啦！</p>\n<p>Bioshroom 内容：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1468/382/2026-01-14_22.png\"></p>\n<p>Magnolia 内容：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1468/383/2026-01-14_22.png\"></p>\n<p>Mauve 内容：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1468/384/2026-01-14_23.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>所需依赖：</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/addonslib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AddonsLib</strong></a></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/regions-unexplored\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Regions Unexplored</a></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>可选依赖：</strong></p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/sketch_macaw/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Macaw's Mods</a></strong></p>",
